    "long_instructions": "# Practice\r\n\r\nMany AI systems learn by finding patterns in past data. For example, if an AI is trained on previous college admissions decisions, it will learn what kinds of students were admitted and use those patterns to make future recommendations. However, AI does not understand fairness—it only learns from the data it is given.\r\n\r\nIn this activity, you will examine a dataset used to train an admissions AI. Your job is to look for patterns in who gets admitted and decide what the AI might learn.\r\n\r\n\r\n> **Guiding Questions**\r\n> * Who tends to get admitted? What patterns do you notice?\r\n> * Who is not getting admitted? What do they have in common?\r\n> * What might an AI learn from this data?\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #222; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">College Admissions Dataset</h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4;\">\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Applicant ID</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">GPA</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">SAT Score</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Extracurriculars</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">First-Gen</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Income Level</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Race/Ethnicity</th>\r\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Admitted</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A1</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.9</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1450</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">4</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">High</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">White</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A2</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.7</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1380</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">High</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Asian</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A3</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.8</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1420</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">5</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">High</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">White</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A4</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.6</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1300</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Low</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Black</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A5</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.5</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1280</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Low</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Hispanic</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A6</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.9</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1400</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">4</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">High</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">White</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A7</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.4</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1250</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Yes</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Low</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">Black</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">A8</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3.7</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">1350</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">3</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">No</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;\">High</td>\r\n<td style=\"bord